nd &lt;kbd&gt;keyboard input&lt;/kbd&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;blockquotes&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Blockquotes &lt;a class=&quot;header-anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://tionosulis.github.io/posts/hello-world/#blockquotes&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a simple blockquote. It should stand out from the surrounding text while remaining readable.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a longer blockquote with multiple paragraphs. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;And this is a nested blockquote for good measure.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;cite&gt;Someone Famous&lt;/cite&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h2 id=&quot;lists&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Lists &lt;a class=&quot;header-anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://tionosulis.github.io/posts/hello-world/#lists&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;unordered&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Unordered &lt;a class=&quot;header-anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://tionosulis.github.io/posts/hello-world/#unordered&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item one&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item two&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nested item A&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nested item B&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item three&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Item four&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;ordered&quot; tabindex=&quot;-1&quot;&gt;Ordered &lt;a class=&quot;header-anchor&quot; href=&quot;https://tionosulis.github.io/posts/hello-world/#ordered&quot;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;First item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Second item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Third item&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nested 3.1&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Nested 3.2&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fourth item&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol